From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikhail Malyshev <mike.malyshev@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 13:14:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ui/dbus: let the client give the identity of the monitor

A D-Bus display client is a UI that knows the monitor showing a console,
EDID included. Let it give that monitor's identity in UIInfo.Apply -
"vendor", "product", "serial_number", "name" and "serial_string", as the
monitor's EDID names it - and read it back with UIInfo.Get. A value
the guest's EDID cannot carry is refused, as a value of the wrong type
already is: a vendor that is not three upper-case letters, and a name
or serial number text longer than 13 characters or with anything but
printable ASCII in it. An empty string clears a text.

Document the keys, which devices use them, that changing them shows to
the guest as another monitor, and that a zero size means no monitor;
Console.SetUIInfo leaves them as they were.

The tests check the identity read back, each kind of value refused,
13 characters taken and a key of no use ignored; that Console.SetUIInfo
and a VNC client's resize leave it as it was; the EDID a virtio-gpu
guest reads, with QEMU's own name for an empty one and an output name
from the device's configuration winning; and another monitor of the
same size - differing in any one field, or given only after the guest
has seen QEMU's own - showing to the guest as the first one going and
the other coming, except to a guest that reads no EDID, and two
identities given at once reaching the device as the last one.

Signed-off-by: Mikhail Malyshev <mike.malyshev@gmail.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 tests/qtest/dbus-display-test.c | 291 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 ui/dbus-console.c               |  90 +++++++++-
 ui/dbus-display1.xml            |  38 ++++-
 3 files changed, 411 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/qtest/dbus-display-test.c b/tests/qtest/dbus-display-test.c
index 23b286a42d..2b4fea51e9 100644
--- a/tests/qtest/dbus-display-test.c
+++ b/tests/qtest/dbus-display-test.c
@@ -463,6 +463,25 @@ test_uiinfo_apply_ok(QemuDBusDisplay1UIInfo *ui_info, GVariant *dict)
 
     g_assert_cmpstr(error, ==, NULL);
 }
+
+static void
+test_uiinfo_apply_invalid(QemuDBusDisplay1UIInfo *ui_info, GVariant *dict)
+{
+    g_autofree char *error = test_uiinfo_apply(ui_info, dict);
+
+    g_assert_cmpstr(error, ==, "org.qemu.Display1.Error.Invalid");
+}
+
+static void
+test_uiinfo_assert_s(QemuDBusDisplay1UIInfo *ui_info, const char *key,
+                     const char *expected)
+{
+    g_autoptr(GVariant) info = test_uiinfo_get(ui_info);
+    const char *s = NULL;
+
+    g_assert_true(g_variant_lookup(info, key, "&s", &s));
+    g_assert_cmpstr(s, ==, expected);
+}
 #if defined(CONFIG_VNC) && !defined(WIN32)
 static void
